          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">If you are ready to start creating UGC content, OKAD's creator network connects creators with brands looking for content across niches including beauty, fitness, food, tech, fashion, and lifestyle. We work with creators at all equipment levels &mdash; a phone and good lighting is all you need to get started. We provide detailed briefs, fair pay, and ongoing work for creators who deliver quality content consistently.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">To join our creator network or learn more about UGC opportunities, email <a href={emailHref} class="text-accent hover:underline">olga@okad.agency</a> with your portfolio or sample content. For step-by-step guidance on building your UGC career, see our <a href="/how-to-start-canvas-ugc/" class="text-accent hover:underline">how to start Canvas UGC</a> and <a href="/ugc-beginner/" class="text-accent hover:underline">UGC beginner</a> guides.</p>
